{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-4789-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "name": "NutriBot API",
    "description": "Collection do Projeto Diamante (NutriBot).\n\nRode no Collection Runner, **na ordem**, com a API recém-subida em http://localhost:8080.\n\nO H2 é recriado a cada inicialização (66 alimentos, perfil da Marina com 1800 kcal, refeições de hoje e de ontem). Sem reiniciar, a segunda execução quebra os testes do diário, porque o chat grava um ovo.\n\nAs pastas de chat, RAG e `/meals/analyze` chamam o modelo. Defina `OPENAI_API_KEY` antes de subir a API. Cada chamada pode levar alguns segundos.\n\nErros do contrato devem vir como `{ \"error\": \"...\" }`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
    { "key": "today", "value": "" },
    { "key": "yesterday", "value": "" },
    { "key": "tapiocaId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "bananaId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "createdMealId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "conversationA", "value": "" },
    { "key": "conversationB", "value": "" },
    { "key": "countBeforeLog", "value": "" },
    { "key": "countAfterLog", "value": "" }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "function localIso(date) {",
          "    const month = String(date.getMonth() + 1).padStart(2, '0');",
          "    const day = String(date.getDate()).padStart(2, '0');",
          "    return date.getFullYear() + '-' + month + '-' + day;",
          "}",
          "const now = new Date();",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('today', localIso(now));",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('yesterday', localIso(new Date(now.getFullYear(), now.getMonth(), now.getDate() - 1)));"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 Alimentos",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Tabela completa",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/foods"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 e 66 alimentos', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.lengthOf(66);",
                  "});",
                  "const tapioca = pm.response.json().find(food => food.name === 'Tapioca');",
                  "const banana = pm.response.json().find(food => food.name === 'Banana prata');",
                  "pm.test('tapioca tem 240 kcal por 100 g', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(tapioca, 'Tapioca').to.be.an('object');",
                  "    pm.expect(tapioca.calories).to.be.closeTo(240, 0.01);",
                  "    pm.expect(tapioca.carbs).to.be.closeTo(60, 0.01);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('tapiocaId', String(tapioca.id));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('bananaId', String(banana.id));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Buscar tapioca",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/foods?name=tapioca"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const foods = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('200 e só tapioca', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    pm.expect(foods.length).to.be.at.least(1);",
                  "    foods.forEach(food => pm.expect(food.name.toLowerCase()).to.include('tapioca'));",
                  "    pm.expect(foods[0].calories).to.be.closeTo(240, 0.01);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Buscar por id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/foods/{{tapiocaId}}"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 com o mesmo alimento', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    const food = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(food.name).to.eql('Tapioca');",
                  "    pm.expect(food.id).to.eql(Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('tapiocaId')));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Alimento inexistente",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/foods/999999"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('404 no formato error', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(404);",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().error).to.be.a('string').that.is.not.empty;",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
